### GET /api/assets/employee/{employee} — GET /api/assets/employee/{id}: current and past assets of one employee
GET {{host}}/api/assets/employee/{{employee}}
Accept: application/json
Cookie: {{session_cookie_name}}={{session}}; XSRF-TOKEN={{xsrf}}

